#: admin/classes/Admin.php:257
#, php-format
msgid ""
"⚠️ Clean Temporary Storage?\n"
"\n"
"This will permanently delete all files in the temporary storage directory.\n"
"\n"
"✓ What gets deleted:\n"
"  • Temporary storage files (%d-day recovery)\n"
"  • Frees ~50% of current backup space immediately\n"
"\n"
"✓ What remains safe:\n"
"  • Permanent backups (can still be restored)\n"
"  • Backups remain available for the full retention period\n"
"\n"
"💡 Recommended: Test restore functionality first (Backups page) before cleaning temporary files.\n"
"\n"
"Click OK to proceed with cleanup."
msgstr ""

